    {
      "text": "City list names this Old Burlington Site Mixed-Use Redevelopment (Residential), APN 002-201-570. This record is on 002-201-140.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: about 85 feet tall; over 350,000 sq ft total, including about 250,000 sq ft of housing, 10,000 sq ft of retail and under 100,000 sq ft of parking. Studios through three-bedrooms; more than two-thirds of units have a private balcony or terrace.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002579"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bisnow: 13,000 sq ft of amenities and 10,000 sq ft of ground-floor retail.",
